          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=Act as a senior SEO keyword strategist.\nYour task is to create 5 long-tail keywords from the base keyword \"{{ $json.keyword }}\".\n\nRules:\n\nEach keyword must be 4–8 words.\n\nAdd clear search intent words such as “best,” “cheap,” “guide,” “ideas,” “for,” “2025,” “cost,” “top,” or “comparison.”\n\nTarget high-RPM intent—topics that attract commercial advertisers (travel bookings, insurance, finance, gadgets, education, software, healthcare, etc.).\n\nInclude a mix of informational, commercial, and transactional search phrases.\n\nAvoid duplicates or vague results.\n\nReturn clean JSON only in this format (no array, no notes):\n\n{\"longtail\": \"best travel destinations in december for couples\"}\n{\"longtail\": \"cheap warm travel destinations in december 2025\"}\n{\"longtail\": \"travel destinations in december in asia\"}\n{\"longtail\": \"top winter travel destinations in europe 2025\"}\n{\"longtail\": \"best budget travel destinations for december holidays\"}",
              "role": "=user"
